SABLE is an unofficial fan project, not affiliated with or endorsed by
NumWorks. The desert, the sand simulation, the statues, the disasters, the
tools of the Labo and every text of SABLE are original work made for this
project: everything on screen is computed by code (apps/home/sable/ in the
patch). The statues are made from the icons of the apps installed on the
calculator itself; no image, sound or logo is taken from anywhere else.
